          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Coforge CEO: AI Is Changing Tech Services Demand, Not Killing It — Firms That Lead Outcomes Will Win",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Coforge CEO Sudhir Singh has publicly pushed back against narratives of AI-led demand collapse in IT services, arguing that the market is evolving into new value pools centred on AI-led modernisation and governance. He dismissed fears of AI firms displacing traditional IT services companies, framing them as specialists within a broader, growing market. The statement carries weight given Coforge's Q4 FY26 profit more than doubled to Rs 612 crore, suggesting its own AI-driven approach is yielding results.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/information-tech/tech-services-demand-is-changing-not-weakening-coforge-ceo/articleshow/130915873.cms",
            "publisher": {
